# The build context is this repository. It holds no Dockerfile of its own — it composes images
# published elsewhere (the services, the gateway) and the platform infrastructure images.
#
# What matters here is not uploading anything, it is NOT hiding the files docker compose reads.

.git/
.gitignore
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/TestResults/
**/coverage/

README.md